OL,3,AWhat happened after a small town
OL,4,Aintroduced a balaclava ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut 12 miles (19km) away, one small
OL,7,Ftown in Derbyshire has been quietly
OL,8,Fpioneering a ban for more than two
OL,9,Fyears.
OL,11,FHeanor, a market town with a population
OL,12,Fof more than 24,000, took action after
OL,13,Fan increase in reports of anti-social
OL,14,Fbehaviour.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
